    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d296">

                <pb facs="0334" n="250" sameAs="frus:frus1903/pg250"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Acapulco, Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-11-04"><hi rendition="#italic">November 4,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary of the Navy</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Washington, D. C:</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Marblehead</hi> and <hi rendition="#italic">Concord</hi>
                    to Panama to-day 4 p.m.; <hi rendition="#italic">Wyoming</hi> will follow
                    to-morrow afternoon. If <hi rendition="#italic">Boston</hi> is to go with
                    squadron, I would suggest Department will order her to rendezvous off Cape Mala,
                    Colombia, about 6 p.m., on November 9. I have ordered <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Nero</hi> to Acapulco. I will leave sealed orders for her to proceed
                    without delay to Panama unless otherwise directed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Glass.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
